@page "/disclaimer"

<PageTitle>Disclaimer - 7 Guys House of Fashion</PageTitle>

<div class="customer-page">
    <div class="customer-header">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h1" Class="customer-title">Disclaimer</MudText>
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body2" Class="customer-subtitle">Please read this before placing an order or creating an account.</MudText>
    </div>

    <MudStack Spacing="4">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
            7 Guys House of Fashion is a real, legitimate business, but this website is just a student
            capstone project and is not the official website of 7 Guys House of Fashion. Any orders,
            designs, or accounts made here are for demonstration purposes only and will not be
            processed by the business.
        </MudText>

        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
            The project was originally built in PHP/Laravel and has since been rebuilt from the ground up
            in C#/Blazor, both as a personal challenge and as an improvement on the legacy version.
        </MudText>

        <MudText Typo="Typo.body1">
            Please avoid entering any sensitive personal information while using this site.
        </MudText>
    </MudStack>
</div>
